<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 1.2 BLN OF ITS BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 1.2 BLN OF ITS BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland offered to sell 450 million zlotys worth of its 182-day bills, and 750 million zlotys worth of its 273-day paper, bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
